{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/268041-explain-world-of-darkness-books-in-a-sentence-or-less","id":268041,"title":"Explain World of Darkness books in a sentence or less","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-28T23:45:22-07:00","id":268041,"title":"Explain World of Darkness books in a sentence or less","content":"<u>Vampire the Masquerade</u><br /> Modern Game of Thrones: now with extra incest.<br /> <br /> <u>Werewolf the Apocalypse</u><br /> Furry Green Peace Terrorists<br /> <br /> <u>Mage The Ascension</u><br /> Selfish Sociopath With God Complex: The Game<br /> <br /> <u>Hunter The Reckoning</u><br /> Egotistical Psychopath with God Complex...The Game<br /> <br /> <u>Wraith The Oblivion</u><br /> Casper: 90's Grunge Edition.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T02:25:23-07:00","id":268107,"title":"","content":"Vampire: You're the bad guy. Your friends are also villains.<br /> Werewolf: You're fighting a war, and you're losing.<br /> Mage: You're fighting a war you already lost.<br /> Wraith: You lost, you died, and now you're trying to avoid a fate worse than death.<br /> Changeling: You're fighting a war and nobody is taking you seriously.<br /> Hunter: You're fighting a war where everyone's bigger than you and trying to kill you.<br /> Mummy: You're immortal... that's it.<br /> Demon: You're fighting a cold war with mixed results.<br /> Orpheus: You're mortal and dying temporarily is part of your job.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T14:47:28-07:00","id":268556,"title":"","content":"Werewolf: Furry Planeteers without Captain Planet: The eco-villains are winning,.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3117-lucius","name":"Lucius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T15:47:02-07:00","id":268583,"title":"","content":"Gypsy: That's racist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I seem to have acquired a site for running play by post games. This is unexpected and frightening and come watch either the glorious play or the magnificent train wreck:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">The Malkavian Madness Network</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1515-benjcano","name":"BenjCano","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:34:29-07:00","id":269252,"title":"","content":"<u>Vampire the Masquerade</u><br /> How to Eat People and Keep Secrets<br /> <br /> <u>Werewolf the Apocalypse</u><br /> Eco-Terrorism: Now with Claws<br /> <br /> <u>Mage The Ascension</u><br /> Phenominal cosmic power; itty bitty dice pools.<br /> <br /> <u>Hunter The Reckoning</u><br /> Supernaturals in Denial<br /> <br /> <u>Wraith The Oblivion</u><br /> Second Chances, the Game<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T10:47:06-07:00","id":269259,"title":"","content":"New Edition:<br /> <br /> <b>Requiem</b>: Unlife <i>sucks, </i>no pun intended.<br /> <br /> <b>Forsaken:</b> You're one warrior for every five enemies.<br /> <br /> <b>Awakening:</b> Working on a Mystery, going wherever it leads...<br /> <br /> <b>Promethean:</b> One monster's quest to exchange power for having a halfway decent existence.<br /> <br /> <b>Lost:</b> Start running.<br /> <br /> <b>Vigil:</b> We have no idea what we're doing!<br /> <br /> <b>Geist: </b>We do things!<br /> <br /> <b>Cursed: </b>Wake up, brush artifacts, set centuries long scheme in motion, go to bed, repeat.<br /> <br /> <b>Descent: </b>Start running, Cyborg Edition.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T11:35:25-07:00","id":269310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Vigil</b> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> In this game you play as trolls, PKing all the other gamelines.</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T12:47:16-07:00","id":269350,"title":"","content":"<b>V:TM:</b> You're damned and there's some ancient powers are out to control you.<br /> <b>C:TL: </b>If the true Fae don't get you, your psychological baggage will.<br /> <b>W:tO: </b>Life is a bitch, but death is a total asshole.<br /> <b>The Eastern line: </b>Stupid gaijun, we Asians are better and perfect compared to you.<br /> <b>Slashers:</b> All your favorite violent movies in one big package.<br /> <b>M:tA:</b> A little bit of everything for good and for ill.<br /> <b>Promethean: </b>Why bother? Everyone is going to hate you eventually.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T21:50:21-07:00","id":269833,"title":"","content":"Vampire: Lots of assaulting people with sudden violence and coercion, and it should definitely remind you of something.<br /> Werewolf: Grendel tries to be Beowulf, and often ruins it by going on rampages.<br /> (with Mokole): Attack on Godzilla's Creed<br /> Mage: Post-modernism, the might-be-game.<br /> Wraith: The Frighteners, only with oppressive ghost empires and lots of Jungian psychology..<br /> Changeling: Desperation wearing a beautiful mask.<br /> KotE: A good justification to remove Noddism's narrative weight from the metatext of Vampire.<br /> Hunter: They Live combined with Darker Than Black and a library of classic horror films.<br /> Demon: Is it Biblical, or Sumerian, or some... third... thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T13:03:58-07:00","id":270312,"title":"","content":"<b>Werewolf: the Apocalypse</b>: Hyperviolent furry racist <i>Captain Planet</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Mage: the Ascension</b>: <i>Planescape</i> but the setting is modern day Earth and everyone is a goth.<br /> <br /> <b>Wraith: the Oblivion</b>: A beautiful metaphor for the struggle with depression and other mental illness, masquerading as a game about ghosts.<br /> <br /> <b>Kindred of the East</b>: Asia consists of China and Japan, and it's all anime.<br /> <br /> <b>World of Darkness</b>: An edgy 90s comic book filled to bursting with racism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T00:20:51-07:00","id":270651,"title":"","content":"<u>Kindred of the East</u><br /> Quite possibly a primary contributor to why North Korea hates the west.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T06:52:42-07:00","id":270789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/268041-explain-world-of-darkness-books-in-a-sentence-or-less?p=270651#post270651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Kindred of the East</u><br /> Quite possibly a primary contributor to why North Korea hates the west.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Kindred of the East</b>: Asia consists of China and Japan, and it's all anime. </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>The Eastern line: </b>Stupid gaijun, we Asians are better and perfect compared to you. </div> </div> </div><b>Vampire:</b> Game about Christianity being right and every other culture wrong with undead Vampire creatures rule the western world behind the scenes.<br /> <b>Werewolf: </b>Game where drunken Irish, mad Russian and violent German werewolves join together to murder everyone in the name of nature worship.<br /> <b>Mage: </b>Did I say that Vampires ruled the world, no it's actually technomages but worry not bloody pagans, goth kids, drug users and Christians all join hands in opposition to form a reality where magic and belief rules over science.<br /> <br /> etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T13:05:16-07:00","id":271701,"title":"","content":"Vampire: a Christian supernatural conspiracy punk comic book filled to the brim with racist caricatures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T13:11:41-07:00","id":272449,"title":"","content":"Werewolf: Heavy metal album to fuck shit up.<br /> Vampire: Always stereotyping Werewolves as eco-terrorists or Captain Planet.<br /> Mage: MMMMAAADDDD SSSSCCCCCIIIIIEEEENNNNCCCCCEEEEE!<br /> Wraith: Haunting 101.<br /> Changeling: NNNNNEEEEEERRRRRDDDDDD!<br /> Hunter: Carry on my Wayward Son.<br /> Mummy: Can I get Boris Karloff's autograph?<br /> Sorcerer: Watch American Horror Story Coven without the Vampire politics.<br /> Freak Legion: EEEeee.......eeeeewwwwww.....uuuuuuuu!<br /> Kuei-jin: Tekken + DBZ + Blood equals?<br /> Demon: Your soul is mine!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T17:33:00-07:00","id":272591,"title":"","content":"Werewolf: Something for people hypersensitive to racial sterotypes to complain about.<br /> Vampire: Something for people hypersensitive about &quot;Christianity&quot; to complain about.<br /> And so on...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":300,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/300-hod","user":"HOD","date":". 10-04-2014, 08:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/300-hod","name":"HOD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar300_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"466"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T06:03:43-07:00","id":272895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Werewolf: Something for people hypersensitive to racial sterotypes to complain about. </div> </div> </div>YMMV, I'm a person who lurks in 4chan and plays Cards Against Humanity, but some stuff was really that offensive in pre-W20 era from my POV. There is lot of stuff to complain about back then, and it's good the writers learned to handle issues better.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T08:06:38-07:00","id":272938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/268041-explain-world-of-darkness-books-in-a-sentence-or-less?p=272895#post272895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> YMMV, I'm a person who lurks in 4chan and plays Cards Against Humanity, but some stuff was really that offensive in pre-W20 era from my POV. There is lot of stuff to complain about back then, and it's good the writers learned to handle issues better.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Pre-W20 covers a wide area. Revised might have had the baggage on Pure Breed that W20 rid itself of, but it also cleaned house for everything other than the Children of Gaia. The Fianna were focused on lore and passion instead of alcohol, the Get of Fenris had killed off their Swords of Heimdall camp for being racist tools, and John North Wind's Son was the Wendigo image character in place of Mighty Whitey Evan Heals the Past.",